 a daycare. Here's a look at the fight: Stickers everywhereBrainrot covers the wheel in colorful stickers. Keep your timing sharp and hit the white attack windows to peel them away while you fight back. Welcome to daycareThe room is full of toys, little copies of Brainrot, and some very unsettling children. The lullaby makes the whole thing even worse. Keep ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T11:44:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067933041","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:26:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5071780-1842212951301040","game_id":"steam-5071780","kind":"update","title":"Click Bait - New Elite Enemy Update - The MMORPG","summary":"I changed up all the rules for this fight, there are no longer white nodes on the wheel, instead we have blue nodes and clicking on them fills up your mana bar to let you cast spells! I had so much fun making this fight and setup the scene. Setting up all of the mechanics of the tank/healear/mage/ranger was a really challenging but rewarding build.I used the 4 starting characters from my other game Path Defenders in this fight, that game is basically single player MMO also on Steam.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-27T19:00:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951301040","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:26:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5071780":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:22Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:22Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5071780":"2026-10-26T07:59:22Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5071780":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:22Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:22Z","status":"ok","error_co